The household model sources used by the catalog: the garage ventilation grille,
the satellite speaker wall mount, the shower rail mount, the curtain rod caps, the
hinge tolerance test and the shared lock-plate module, plus the upstream LICENSE,
copied verbatim from the pinned commit. These files use the BOSL library, which is
already vendored separately as bosl-4ce427a8. The rest of the repository is not
vendored.

